===Pronoun===
{{en-pron}}

# {{lb|en|literally}} [[all|All]] the [[thing]]s under [[discussion]].
#: {{ux|en|I checked the list again and '''everything''' is done.}}
#: {{ux|en|Thank you for '''everything''' you've done for us.}}
#* {{RQ:Lincoln Pratt's Patients|page=97|passage=I told him about '''everything''' I could think of; and what I couldn't think of he did. He asked about six questions during my yarn, but every question had a point to it. At the end he bowed and thanked me once more. As a thanker he was main-truck high; I never see anybody so polite.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial|hyperbole}} [[many|Many]] or [[most]] [[thing]]s.
#: {{ux|en|{{upright|A:}} What do you want to do at the amusement park?<br>{{upright|B:}} '''Everything'''!}}
#: {{ux|en|I did '''everything''' today – washed the dishes, cut the lawn, did the laundry.}}
#* {{RQ:Dickens Haunted House|chapter=The Ghost in Master B's Room|page=30|column=2|passage=Then, I was sent to a great, cold, bare, school of big boys; where '''everything''' to eat and wear was thick and clumpy, without being enough; {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} A [[state]] of [[well-being]] (from all [[part]]s of the [[whole]]).
#: {{ux|en|'''Everything''' failed, didn't it?}}
#: {{ux|en|She wasn't feeling well this morning but now '''everything''' is fine.}}
#: {{ux|en|Since the company lost its best customer '''everything''' has gotten worse.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} Considerable effort.
#: {{ux|en|It took '''everything''' in me to resist the temptation to skip work on my birthday.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} The most important thing.
#: {{ux|en|I can't believe I made it in time – timing is '''everything'''!}}

